inish equipment and a timing graphic (Omega) appear in frames 22‑25, reinforcing that this is a timed short‑distance race.  \n5. **Contextual Clues** – Olympic rings, stadium signage, and commentary audio (implied) place the scene at the **London 2012 Olympics**, where the men’s 100\u202fm is a marquee event.\n\n### Verdict  \n\nAll visual evidence across the frames points to the race being the **men’s 100‑meter sprint**. The correct answer to the question *“How many meters is the race about men in the video?”* is therefore:\n\n**C\u202f→\u202f100\u202fm**.', 'failed_images': [('/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/Z86xysw5Ncc/frames/frame_0000.jpg', 'File not found'), ('/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/Z86xysw5Ncc/frames/frame_2308.jpg', 'File not found'), ('/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/Z86xysw5Ncc/frames/frame_2309.jpg', 'File not found')]}

